{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "c4a00d46dc0aabc59a909350e617892856204904826cb11a32af691db2cbc8de", "ja": "どんなお洋服が好みなのかなぁ？\nシックな雰囲気か……それとも、派手な感じ？", "zh": "你喜欢什么样的服装呢？\n是偏典雅的风格……还是比较华丽？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "9fc958497327b82aaa52f0352be50ab86861739b57e488e05138a9d1e2ed4ef2", "ja": "コンセプトがハッキリしている方が、\nわかりやすいかな？　ナースとか、CAとか……。", "zh": "概念明确一些的话，会不会更容易理解？比如护士装、空乘制服之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0ca9de8b9ed7180b834e385ae8c7242ac565272999e16ce3f4d3aca6f830fdbb", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れさまです。\nもしかして、新しい衣装の考案中ですか？", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。\n您该不会是在构思新服装吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "5cb085e9cf7ef19c39a907f66b4b82141995277255979b29f45014d964de0af0", "ja": "あっ、お疲れさまです！　そういうワケではなくて、\nえっと……ただの趣味というか……。", "zh": "啊，辛苦了！并不是那样的，\n呃……该说只是兴趣爱好吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a46e29cda908f4997ab7659bc4218e7a75e06386c32f1963bc70680eda532d02", "ja": "なるほど。\n青羽さんは、本当に衣装が好きなんですね！", "zh": "原来如此。\n青羽小姐真的很喜欢服装呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "ab2af1a203d9812f95ecb48a2e687fbd6cb457dad621126b6383f56a89ef5e93", "ja": "えへへ♪　そうなんです。\n事務員になれて、本当によかったなぁって……あっ！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪是呀。我真的觉得，能成为事务员太好了……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "ce45a254ec4a5c9414c3c7ffeb012d9758013ad9c21cd0fbbd160a8ebad7c8ab", "ja": "そうだ、趣味じゃなくてお仕事の話をしなくちゃ！\n社長さんが呼んでましたよ！", "zh": "对了，不能聊兴趣爱好，得说工作的事才行！\n社长叫您过去哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "be4d58b4e07477ba79af3d48512c36b46bcee735a0bcb74b33a0527ea68f67af", "ja": "お、そうなんですね。また新しい企画の話かな？\nとりあえず事務所に行ってみますね。", "zh": "哦，原来是这样啊。又有新的企划要谈吗？\n我先去事务所看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "2db00a9016e31c8212eb7328cb1a3c9a760e43f6e239d1b568a0e0838bd50aba", "ja": "はーい！　いってらっしゃ～い♪", "zh": "好——！路上小心～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "5b16c99196eba22b75590d9ad1a251baaa0271eb8a1fae45a46f6fa720181cf0", "ja": "アイドルって、本当にたくさんいるんですね……。\nはあ、まさにアイドル戦国時代！", "zh": "偶像真的有好多呢……\n唉，真是偶像战国时代！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "d5ab53ad14e1842f36c01e09c8f8fb8ffbb80456ceca6d9726889670f593b16f", "ja": "事務所にもそれぞれ特色があるしね。\nもちろん、所属するアイドルもいろいろだ。", "zh": "每家事务所都有各自的特色嘛。\n当然，所属的偶像也各不相同。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "87d74ccca400903a440d9c640b2cfdcfcb92c144938003eeeb97fa5b7f1822fd", "ja": "わ、100人以上が所属する事務所もありますよ！\nうう、事務のお仕事が大変そう……。", "zh": "哇，还有超过100人所属的事务所呢！\n呜呜，事务工作感觉会好辛苦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "401591987e06fc1a0d0cc6de7359682e16f1fadaf0ea981a9b3540dba52ed73f", "ja": "ははは、さすが音無君は目の付け所が違うねぇ。", "zh": "哈哈哈，不愧是音无，关注的地方就是不一样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "410f6d917725e3baaeb7bdb13f5101967d553376ec9cdcb5e0ac426e72cde9a8", "ja": "社長、失礼します。\nあれ？　何を見てるんですか？", "zh": "社长，打扰了。\n咦？您在看什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "06c4ace3ca2609ebcdbca8d871b316b5e511fd03ac5af5c00458ecc9103b5f88", "ja": "おお、君！　待っていたよ。\n今、アイドル名鑑を見ていたところなんだ。", "zh": "哦，是你！我正等着你呢。\n我刚才正在看偶像名鉴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "2d93bdbc9a297ecf1c0dcaf7a2c5f0d5421458a96b422be8548f224679f96352", "ja": "アイドル名鑑？　なるほど……。\nところで社長、お仕事の話があるとか？", "zh": "偶像名鉴？原来如此……话说回来，社长，您说有工作的事要谈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "3950367c36a26514daf0ff62eed28d51ee75c09911e2acc4f45019f33d944b32", "ja": "おっと、そうだったそうだった。\nうおっほん！", "zh": "哎呀，对了对了。  \n咳咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "d51f29e61d41bc2237ec1678d5e3d09f0c373cb947467dd536857cd4da5b2311", "ja": "アイドル諸君の頑張りと、君達スタッフのおかげで、\n我が765プロの運営は順調にいっている！", "zh": "多亏各位偶像的努力，以及你们工作人员的帮助，\n我们765事务所的运营进展得很顺利！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "47de6ef6da1c6527eec4ebc90a3add1b2db5aa03bc8bc31b17c7bb756f6b1ce3", "ja": "そこで、このあたりでひとつ……ちょっと\n変わったことを企画してみようと思ってね。", "zh": "所以，我想在这附近策划一件……稍微\n特别一点的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "2ade0a9eaab8c1b70f8d367034dd319765a37500b9092dde0bba5b497d8b9cbe", "ja": "変わったこと……といいますと？", "zh": "特别的事……指的是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "3ad2a3df2010a429e11b8873e4eb7d0bbb4d6b556d773326a931fda6bdf2027b", "ja": "うむ。次の公演はひとつ、他の事務所のアイドルを招待\nして、盛大にコラボ公演をしようと思っているのだよ！", "zh": "嗯。关于下一场公演，我正想着邀请\n其他事务所的偶像，热热闹闹地办一场合作演出呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "813bdab523ba4529e6c27b5939e27020b7c6ecbae3eeb7c3603f3b80e5884145", "ja": "コラボ公演を、劇場で……！\nなるほど、それは盛り上がりそうですね！", "zh": "在剧场举办联动公演……！原来如此，那一定会很热闹！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "1d2b92c511e9605875616ff9be2d6fc3a8e86abfd04d56cb119703d32049adeb", "ja": "そうだろう？　君なら賛成してくれると思っていたよ！\nというわけで、今回も君に全て一任しよう！", "zh": "没错吧？我就知道你会赞成的！\n所以这次也全权交给你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "790b69c2311f4b0c92c7798edfc028ce0310ca52a87077cf4d262ea0c32e87f3", "ja": "社長、そういうのは丸投げって言うんじゃ……。", "zh": "社长，这种做法不就叫做甩手掌柜吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "bad049155c4237244e8b63d5affed946ae65c5590b707812bee23d63dc61996c", "ja": "いやいやいや、何を言ってるんだ音無君！\nこれは信頼というものだよ！", "zh": "不不不，你在说什么呢音无君！\n这就是所谓的信任啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "a4444d338ad1302386eaa377884cf67bfb00b55c868cf89551b003365c349a05", "ja": "というわけで、どうかね？\nこの大役、君は引き受けて……。", "zh": "那么，你意下如何？\n这个重任，你愿意接下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_1027", "source_sha256": "a3efa602a3883d897be0f8eb573f37a833c628aa4a926574b29fc7fbe3615df7", "ja": "引き受けます！", "zh": "接受！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "f0ea1478e27cbf27c769af72aeb45a880ed0c3b9363b35898165814b8c5207a5", "ja": "もちろん、引き受けさせてもらいます！\n信頼してくれて、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "当然，我非常乐意接受！\n感谢您对我的信任！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "83c225a9c9a4870005c2f3a26b5a72646c5d60c448b84ae75cb9e398da91c59c", "ja": "おおっ、食い気味に引き受けてくれるとは頼もしい！\n私も社長冥利につきるというものだ。", "zh": "哦哦，没想到你这么爽快就答应了，真可靠！\n我这个社长也算是没白当了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_2003_president", "source_sha256": "952f1493dc4ca73e52aced9924373a70d9ed7952bb419b2a36a93c05bcab1be2", "ja": "君の力で、劇場に新しい風を吹かせてくれたまえ！\n期待しているよ～！", "zh": "用你的力量，为剧场吹进一阵新风吧！\n我很期待哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_2004_101kot", "source_sha256": "7d9e1199340393c2c0317d23e1efb2a61f7e189dcc549a965f401fc99023fc9a", "ja": "もう、社長ったら。{$P$}さん、\n何かあったら、私もフォローしますから！", "zh": "真是的，社长。{$P$}先生，要是有什么事，我也会帮忙的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_2005_101kot", "source_sha256": "887657a7435350401ae671f91637691d5b1f51b27e5790d8c294efd7e74f2a5a", "ja": "サポートが必要なときは、相談してくださいね。\nなんでしたら、プライベートの事でも……なんてっ♪", "zh": "需要帮助的时候，请来找我商量哦。\n如果是私事的话，也可以来找我商量……之类的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0160_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_intro_2006_p", "source_sha256": "2a48b2d4180bb62704b90d217c663d2e28676290b86e81f46355fe67de679621", "ja": "（コラボ公演……うちのアイドル達にとっても、\nいい刺激になりそうだ。早速、企画をまとめよう！）", "zh": "（联动公演……对我们家的偶像们来说，似乎也会是很好的刺激。马上来整理企划吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
